---
import ServicePage from '../../layouts/ServicePage.astro';
import FAQAccordion from '../../components/FAQAccordion.astro';

const faqItems = [
  {
    question: 'Should I use WordPress or a modern framework for my Christchurch business website?',
    answer: 'It depends on your requirements. WordPress is an excellent choice if you need extensive content management capabilities, a large ecosystem of plugins, or if your team is already familiar with the WordPress admin interface. Modern frameworks like Astro or Next.js are better if performance, speed, and security are your top priorities, or if your site is primarily content-based with complex interactive features. We assess your specific needs and recommend the best platform rather than pushing a one-size-fits-all solution.'
  },
  {
    question: 'Can you fix my slow WordPress website?',
    answer: 'Yes, regularly. Slow WordPress sites are extremely common because of plugin bloat, unoptimised themes, poor hosting, and bloated databases. Our WordPress performance optimisation service audits your site, identifies the specific causes of slowness, and implements fixes that typically reduce load times by fifty to eighty percent. This includes optimising or replacing heavy plugins, implementing caching, cleaning the database, optimising images, and in some cases recommending a migration to a faster platform.'
  },
  {
    question: 'Is WordPress secure enough for my business?',
    answer: 'WordPress itself is secure when properly maintained. The security risks come from outdated plugins, themes, and core software, as well as poor server configuration. We harden WordPress installations with security best practices including limited login attempts, two-factor authentication, file monitoring, automatic updates, and regular security scans. For businesses with higher security requirements, we may recommend modern alternatives with smaller attack surfaces.'
  },
  {
    question: 'How much does WordPress development cost in Christchurch?',
    answer: 'Custom WordPress development typically ranges from $4,000 for a bespoke theme on a new installation to $15,000 or more for complex sites with custom plugins, integrations, and advanced functionality. WordPress maintenance plans start from $150 per month. We provide detailed, itemised quotes before any work begins.'
  },
  {
    question: 'Can you build custom WordPress plugins?',
    answer: 'Yes. We develop custom WordPress plugins when existing solutions do not meet your requirements. This includes custom post types, advanced form handling, data integrations with external APIs, membership systems, booking engines, and custom admin interfaces. Every plugin we build follows WordPress coding standards and is designed to be maintainable and upgrade-safe.'
  },
  {
    question: 'Do you offer WordPress maintenance and support?',
    answer: 'Yes. Our WordPress care plans include daily backups, core and plugin updates, security monitoring, uptime monitoring, performance checks, content updates, and priority technical support. We handle the technical maintenance so you can focus on your Christchurch business. Plans are flexible and can be tailored to your specific needs.'
  }
];

const jsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Service",
  "name": "WordPress Development Christchurch",
  "description": "Custom WordPress development services for Christchurch businesses. Theme development, plugin customization, security, performance optimization, and ongoing support by Byte Digital.",
  "provider": {
    "@type": "LocalBusiness",
    "name": "Byte Digital",
    "url": "https://bytedigital.co.nz",
    "address": { "@type": "PostalAddress", "addressLocality": "Christchurch", "addressRegion": "Canterbury", "addressCountry": "NZ" }
  },
  "areaServed": { "@type": "City", "name": "Christchurch" },
  "sameAs": []
};

const relatedServices = [
  { href: '/services/web-design', label: 'Web Design' },
  { href: '/services/web-development', label: 'Web Development' },
  { href: '/services/ecommerce', label: 'eCommerce' },
  { href: '/services/seo', label: 'SEO' },
  { href: '/services/website-maintenance', label: 'Website Maintenance' },
  { href: '/services/custom-applications', label: 'Custom Applications' },
  { href: '/services/local-seo', label: 'Local SEO' },
  { href: '/services/branding', label: 'Branding' }
];
---

<ServicePage
  title="WordPress Development Christchurch | WordPress Experts NZ | Byte Digital"
  description="Byte Digital provides expert WordPress development for Christchurch businesses. Custom themes, plugin development, security hardening, performance optimization, and migration services."
  serviceTitle="WordPress Development Christchurch"
  serviceSubtitle="Custom WordPress solutions that are fast, secure, and built to grow with your business."
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <section class="section dot-pattern">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width:800px;margin:0 auto">

        <h2 style="color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:28px;margin-bottom:16px">Expert WordPress Development for Christchurch Businesses</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.8">WordPress powers more than forty percent of all websites globally, and its market share in New Zealand is equally significant. For many Christchurch businesses, WordPress remains a practical and powerful platform for managing web content. However, a WordPress site is only as good as the development behind it. A poorly built WordPress site can be slow, insecure, and difficult to maintain, while a well-architected WordPress installation can be fast, reliable, and a pleasure to manage.</p>
        <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.8">At Byte Digital, we bring modern development practices to WordPress. We do not rely on page builders that produce bloated code. We build custom themes with clean, semantic HTML, optimise performance rigorously, and harden security to protect your Christchurch business from threats. When WordPress is the right tool for the job, we make it shine.</p>

        <h2 style="color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:28px;margin-top:48px;margin-bottom:16px">Custom WordPress Theme Development</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.8">Unlike agencies still using dated WordPress templates or visual page builders that generate excessive code, we build custom WordPress themes from scratch. Every theme we develop is designed specifically for your Christchurch business, coded to WordPress standards, and optimised for speed and SEO.</p>
        <ul style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.8;padding-left:24px">
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Semantic HTML structure</strong> that ensures accessibility and search engine crawlability</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Custom post types and taxonomies</strong> tailored to your content structure, whether you are a Christchurch real estate agent managing property listings or a restaurant managing menus</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Advanced Custom Fields integration</strong> that gives your team intuitive content editing controls without the overhead of page builders</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Responsive design</strong> that works flawlessly across phones, tablets, and desktops</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Gutenberg compatibility</strong> with custom block patterns and templates that make content creation efficient</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Performance optimisation</strong> including lazy loading, image optimisation, minimal CSS and JavaScript, and efficient database queries</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 style="color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:28px;margin-top:48px;margin-bottom:16px">Custom Plugin Development</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.8">When existing WordPress plugins do not meet your requirements, we develop custom solutions. Off-the-shelf plugins often include features you do not need, creating unnecessary bloat and potential security vulnerabilities. Our custom plugins are lean, purpose-built, and designed to do exactly what your Christchurch business needs.</p>
        <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.8">We have built custom WordPress plugins for a wide range of functions including booking and scheduling systems, membership and user management platforms, data import and export tools, integration with third-party APIs and CRMs, custom calculators and quoting tools, and <a href="/services/ecommerce" style="color:var(--secondary)">eCommerce</a> functionality extensions. Every plugin follows WordPress coding standards and is fully documented for future maintainability.</p>

        <h2 style="color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:28px;margin-top:48px;margin-bottom:16px">WordPress Performance Optimisation</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.8">WordPress has a reputation for being slow, but this is almost always the result of poor development, excessive plugins, and inadequate hosting, not the platform itself. We specialise in diagnosing and resolving WordPress performance issues for Christchurch businesses.</p>
        <ul style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.8;padding-left:24px">
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Plugin audit:</strong> Identifying and replacing resource-heavy plugins with lighter alternatives or custom code</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Database optimisation:</strong> Cleaning post revisions, transients, spam comments, and optimising database tables</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Caching configuration:</strong> Page caching, object caching with Redis, browser caching, and CDN integration</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Image optimisation:</strong> Automatic compression, WebP conversion, lazy loading, and responsive image handling</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Code optimisation:</strong> Minifying CSS and JavaScript, eliminating render-blocking resources, and deferring non-critical scripts</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Hosting evaluation:</strong> Recommending NZ-based hosting providers configured for optimal WordPress performance</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.8">Our WordPress performance work consistently achieves sub-two-second load times, even for content-rich sites with thousands of pages.</p>

        <h2 style="color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:28px;margin-top:48px;margin-bottom:16px">WordPress Security Hardening</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.8">WordPress is the most targeted content management system by hackers simply because of its market share. However, the vast majority of WordPress compromises are the result of outdated software, weak passwords, and poor server configuration, all of which are preventable.</p>
        <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.8">Our WordPress security service implements multiple layers of protection:</p>
        <ul style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.8;padding-left:24px">
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Login hardening:</strong> Rate limiting, two-factor authentication, and hiding the admin login URL</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">File integrity monitoring:</strong> Alerts when core files, themes, or plugins are modified unexpectedly</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Malware scanning:</strong> Regular automated scans that detect and alert on malicious code</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Firewall configuration:</strong> Web application firewall rules that block common attack patterns</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Automatic updates:</strong> Core, theme, and plugin updates applied promptly after testing</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Automated backups:</strong> Daily off-site backups with one-click restoration capability</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 style="color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:28px;margin-top:48px;margin-bottom:16px">WordPress Migration Services</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.8">If your existing WordPress site is on poor hosting, using an outdated theme, or has become unmaintainable, we can migrate it to a modern, high-performance setup. We handle the entire migration process including setting up a new hosting environment, migrating all content, media, and database records, reconfiguring email and DNS, implementing a new custom theme, testing every page and function, and redirecting old URLs to preserve your SEO rankings.</p>
        <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.8">For businesses that have outgrown WordPress entirely, we also offer migration to modern platforms like Astro or Next.js with a headless CMS. We preserve your content, maintain your SEO authority, and deliver a significantly faster, more secure website.</p>

        <h2 style="color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:28px;margin-top:48px;margin-bottom:16px">WordPress vs Modern Frameworks: When to Use What</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.8">We are committed to recommending the best platform for your specific situation, even if that means recommending something other than WordPress. Here is our honest assessment:</p>
        <ul style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.8;padding-left:24px">
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Choose WordPress when:</strong> You need a content-heavy site with multiple content types, your team is comfortable with the WordPress admin, you need extensive plugin ecosystem access, or you require multisite capabilities</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Choose a modern framework when:</strong> Performance is a top priority, you need advanced interactive features, your site is primarily a marketing or lead generation tool, or you want to minimise security maintenance overhead</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.8">We will never push WordPress simply because it generates more ongoing <a href="/services/website-maintenance" style="color:var(--secondary)">maintenance</a> revenue. Our recommendation is always based on what serves your Christchurch business best.</p>

        <h2 style="color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:28px;margin-top:48px;margin-bottom:16px">WordPress for eCommerce (WooCommerce)</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.8">WooCommerce transforms WordPress into a fully functional eCommerce platform. We build WooCommerce stores with custom product types, advanced filtering, NZ payment gateway integration, shipping configuration, and optimised checkout flows. WooCommerce is particularly well-suited for Christchurch businesses that need tight integration between their online store and their content or blog.</p>

        <h2 style="color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:28px;margin-top:48px;margin-bottom:16px">Why Choose Byte Digital for WordPress in Christchurch</h2>
        <ul style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.8;padding-left:24px">
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Modern development practices:</strong> Clean code, no page builder dependency, performance-first approach</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Honest platform recommendations:</strong> We recommend WordPress only when it genuinely is the best choice</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Custom development:</strong> Themes and plugins built specifically for your business, not modified templates</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Security expertise:</strong> Comprehensive hardening and ongoing monitoring</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Performance focus:</strong> Sub-two-second load times, not the four to six seconds common with poorly built WordPress sites</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:12px"><strong style="color:#fff">Local Christchurch support:</strong> Direct communication with your development team, no overseas ticket systems</li>
        </ul>

        <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.8">Whether you need a new WordPress site, want to improve an existing one, or are considering migrating to a modern platform, we can help. Contact us for a free consultation about your WordPress project.</p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding:60px 0;background:var(--bg-dark);border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04)">
    <div class="container">
      <h3 style="font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-bottom:24px;text-align:center">Related Services</h3>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;justify-content:center">
        {relatedServices.map(s => (
          <a href={s.href} class="btn-ghost" style="padding:10px 24px;font-size:13px">{s.label}</a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Fragment slot="faq">
    <FAQAccordion items={faqItems} />
  </Fragment>
</ServicePage>
